      <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.10</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:channel>preview</sparkle:channel>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 19:18:32 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>- New **Replace originals** option: saves the result under the original's name and moves the original to the Trash.
- **Resize only** is now a toggle in Image settings; the settings popover is wider and has no extra buttons or text. ▶ is the single step that processes and saves.
