    <item>
      <title>Dice 0.1.8</title>
      <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.8</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:channel>preview</sparkle:channel>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 18:51:38 GMT</pubDate>
      <description>Dice 0.1.8 preview

- Convert SVG and every PDF page into images.
- Add GIF, BMP, TIFF and native AVIF export, plus macOS-supported RAW input.
- Extract GIF frames and TIFF pages into separate batch entries.
- Resize all changes resolution only and skips images already smaller than the target.
- Start now processes and saves copies beside originals or in a configured export folder in one action.
- Command-comma opens Settings inside the Dice window.
- Cache previews within a 32 MiB budget and reuse metadata when paging.
- Show resize cursors around window edges and corners.
- Remember optional default export folder and format, plus opt-in automatic update checks in Settings.
</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/lumen-xx/dice-releases/releases/download/v0.1.8/Dice-v0.1.8-apple-silicon.zip" length="10079902" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="y1mrYhraF8biWv2DuCIBZ8TbbiD39aQGkVcDDvyUD0ANGb9YE8QJm8/5oh6s5/1OiwtkSRTFxEMbgRWbshFNDg=="></enclosure>
